    <!-- Neutral900, not the brand green.
         Both apps shipped a byte-identical icon: same green tile, same mark,
         so on a home screen the only thing telling a driver's two VELRO
         installs apart was the label under them. A driver reaching for the
         right app at a station does it by colour, at arm's length, in a
         hurry. Same mark, because it is the same product; different ground,
         because it is not the same app. -->
    <color name="ic_launcher_background">#101828</color>
